            "review_title": "Review at The Heo Bistro - Hidden Cocktail Bar and Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Danielius P\n1 contribution\n0\nFantastic dining experience at The Heo Bistro!\nFeb 2026 • Couples\nFantastic dining experience at The Heo Bistro!\nEverything was spot on – excellent food, a great atmosphere, and very friendly, attentive service. The dishes were creative and full of flavor, the setting felt cozy yet stylish, and the staff made us feel genuinely welcome. One of the best places we ate in Can Tho. Highly recommended if you’re looking for quality food and a relaxed, pleasant evening.\nRead more\nWritten February 5, 2026",
