            "review_title": "Review at The Heo Bistro - Hidden Cocktail Bar and Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Winnie Quyen T\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam90 contributions\n0\n✨ A Hidden Gem in Cần Thơ – Exceptional Cocktails & Cuisine at The Heo & Bistro ✨\nDec 2025 • Friends\nI stumbled into The Heo & Bistro for a casual night out and left genuinely impressed.\n\nCocktails: Ordered a bespoke tequila creation from bartender Nhân — floral notes (quế hoa, jasmine), a playful Brazilian chili kick, and a smooth whisky–cinnamon finish. Three distinct layers, all balanced and beautifully executed.\n\nFood: Chef Tuấn Anh delivered a juicy, perfectly cooked steak, and the pastry was everything it should be — crispy, buttery, and dangerously addictive.\n\nExperience: Didn’t expect a hidden spot in Cần Thơ to deliver this level of craft and creativity. You can feel the heart and professionalism in every detail.\n\nA memorable night — will definitely be back. Highly recommended for anyone who loves great drinks, thoughtful food, and genuine hospitality.\nRead more\nWritten December 7, 2025",
